@bafna35 To fix this, you first need to close your old account:
1. Log in to your PhonePe account on any Android device.
2. Go to your settings and close your UPI Lite account. (Don't worry, any remaining balance will be refunded to your bank.) (2/3)

In October, OpenAI also partnership with National Payments Corporation of India (NPCI) and PhonePe's rival Razorpay.
